category: Libs
requires: cygwin libcurl4 libgcc1 libmicrohttpd12 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Replacing the venerable pupnp/libupnp (runtime)"
ldesc: "The libupnpp library, which provides the C++ interface for upmpdcli and
upplay, used to rely on the venerable libupnp library (a.k.a pupnp: Portable
UPnP) to provide the base UPnP protocol functionality."
external-source: libnpupnp

